<title>LATVIA: SHARE DIRECTION UNCLEAR AT FIX, LIEPAJA OIL UP.</title>
<headline>SHARE DIRECTION UNCLEAR AT FIX, LIEPAJA OIL UP.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares showed little definite</p>
<p>direction at the morning price fix on Friday.</p>
<p>Among share movements, Liepaja oil added eight santimes to</p>
<p>65 santimes while Unibanka was up three to 3.33.</p>
